      "start": 1315
    },
    "text": "Today the app finds one daemon: `locate::locate()` asks `delphi daemon where` for the workspace named by `DELPHI_WORKSPACE`, else `default`. A person with two workspaces, or one that is not called `default`, sees the wrong window or an empty one, and has no way to tell a running daemon from a stopped one."
  }
